    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "==You are reviewing an inventory ledger to identify products that need\nreordering.\n\nLedger (each row is one stock transaction):\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.ledger) }}\n\nProduct reference (thresholds per SKU):\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.products) }}\n\nInstructions:\n1. For each SKU in the product reference, compute current stock by\n   summing ledger quantities for that SKU: add Quantity where Action\n   is \"IN\", subtract where Action is \"OUT\". If a SKU has no ledger\n   entries, treat current stock as 0.\n2. Compare each SKU's current stock to its \"Reorder threshold\" field.\n3. A SKU needs reordering if current stock is at or below its\n   \"Reorder threshold\".\n4. If a SKU needs reordering, the order quantity is equal to its\n   \"Reorder threshold\" value.\n5. If a SKU's \"Reorder threshold\" field is blank or missing, skip it\n   and list it in skipped_items rather than guessing a number.\n\nUse these exact field names from the product reference — do not infer\nor match by meaning:\n- \"SKU\"\n- \"Product Name\"\n- \"Requirement per batch\"\n- \"Raw material (Current)\"\n- \"Reorder threshold\"\n- \"Supplier Name\"\n- \"Supplier Email\"\n\nRespond with ONLY a JSON object (no markdown, no commentary, no text\noutside the object), in exactly this shape:\n\n{\n  \"needs_reorder\": <true if one or more SKUs need reordering, else false>,\n  \"low_stock_items\": [\n    {\n      \"SKU\": \"...\",\n      \"Product Name\": \"...\",\n      \"current_stock\": <integer>,\n      \"threshold\": <integer, from \"Reorder threshold\">,\n      \"order_quantity\": <integer, equal to threshold>,\n      \"supplier_name\": \"...\",\n      \"supplier_email\": \"...\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"skipped_items\": [\n    { \"SKU\": \"...\", \"reason\": \"missing Reorder threshold\" }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        304
      ],
      "id": "233c7fe4-54c6-4108-9d39-0326fe80079c",
      "name": "AI Agent1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const products = $('Product Sheet').all().map(item => item.json);\nconst ledger = $('Inventory').all().map(item => item.json);\n\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    products, \n    ledger\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        816,
        304
      ],
